sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Chat as Chat Service
    participant Config as Config Cache
    participant Budget as Budget Check
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Safety as Safety Filter
    participant Router as Model Router
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant Usage as Usage Tracker

    User->>GW: POST /chat/completions
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT, extract tenant_id
    GW->>GW: Per-tenant rate limit check

    GW->>Chat: Forward with tenant context

    Chat->>Config: Load tenant config (Redis)
    Config-->>Chat: System prompt, safety policy, model tier

    Chat->>Budget: Check token budget (Redis counter)
    alt Over budget
        Budget-->>User: 429 Budget exceeded
    end

    Chat->>PG: Load conversation history (RLS)
    PG-->>Chat: Filtered messages

    Chat->>Chat: Assemble prompt (platform + tenant + history + user)

    Chat->>Safety: Input check (per-tenant policy)
    alt Blocked
        Safety-->>User: Content policy violation
    end

    Chat->>Router: Route by tenant tier
    Router->>LLM: Stream request

    loop Token streaming
        LLM-->>Chat: Token
        Chat->>Safety: Output check
        Chat-->>User: SSE chunk
    end

    Chat->>PG: Save messages (tenant_id)
    Chat->>Usage: Record tokens (async)
    Chat-->>User: SSE done + usage stats
